      "url": "https://robbast.nl/",
      "title": "Rob Bast | Nerd for Hire",
      "text": "Rob Bast\n“ nerd for hire ”\n\nI love a hands-on approach. Give me a keyboard and a task, and I will find a way to get it done, even if it is something completely new to me. Experienced with development in PHP, Javascript, Python and Erlang. Currently focused on CI/CD with Kubernetes on GCP/Azure. The internet has been my playground for well over a decade. For more details about my past experience, download my curriculum vitae.\n\nIn my spare time I like to contribute to and collaborate on various open source projects. Have a look at my GitHub account.\n\nYou can reach me via e-mail or on LinkedIn.",
